#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:190
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:235
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:250
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:324
msgid "Go back"
msgstr "Torna indietro"

#. translators: Title of the dialog shown when the field group's labels are not registered for translation yet. Keep the bold tags. Verb phrase, imperative.
