msgstr "Traduci le etichette dei campi"

#. translators: Body of that dialog. Keep the bold tags around the WPML screen name.
#: classes/FieldGroup/UIHooks.php:213
msgid "To translate field labels, use the <b>Translation Management</b> dashboard."
msgstr "Per tradurre le etichette dei campi, usa la dashboard di <b>Gestione traduzioni</b>."

#. translators: Button that opens WPML's Translation Management dashboard. Keep the bold tags around the screen name. Verb, imperative.
